 Nxc4 Ba6 {Messy.}) Nc5 {[%eval +1.10] The knight lands. Now shut down the queen side for good.} 5. a4 {[%eval +1.01] [%cal Gb5b5]The a pawn stops b5, and his knight has nowhere else to go.}  (5. Nd2 {Chasing the pawn on c4 costs you time.}  b6 6. Nxc4 Ba6 7. Na3 b5 {He gets everything back.})  (5. Bg5 {The bishop gets pushed away and he plays b5 anyway.}  h6 6. Bf4 b5 7. a3 Bb7 {He is active.})  (5. Bf4 {Now b5 comes with the knight hanging on c3.}  b5 6. Nxb5 Nfxe4 7. Bxe4 Nxe4 {Much of your edge is gone.}) 1-0

