he move with a plan.}  b6 6. Qd2 f6 7. Nb5 a6 {He is untangling.})  (5. Qd2 {Same story. Push the pawn while it is free.}  b6 6. Be3 f6 7. Nb5 a6 {Slower.})  (5. Qe2 {The queen has no work on e2.}  b6 6. Bg3 a6 7. Kh1 Ne5 {He is fine.}) 1-0

