way and count your pieces.} 5. O-O {[%eval +1.21] King safe, centre open, and his pawn on e5 is going nowhere.}  (5. Be3 {Also strong. But castling first is the cleanest.}  e4 6. Nd2 Na6 7. O-O Rc8 {Still very good for you.})  (5. Bg5 {The bishop is loose with your king still in the middle.}  e4 6. Nd2 Na6 7. O-O Nc5 {He is fighting back.})  (5. Ng5 {The knight lunge achieves nothing here.}  h6 6. Nge4 Nxe4 7. Nxe4 Bf5 {You gave away the pull.}) 1-0

[Event "Benoni for white: the early knight to h5"]
