 Bc7 6. Nge2 d6 {Awkward.})  (4. Nge2 {Passive. He hits the bishop with the c pawn.}  c4 5. Bc2 Bc5 6. O-O d6 {He is fine.}) Bf8 {[%eval +1.05] The bishop had to go home, and you have a free move. Finish developing.} 5. Nf3 {[%eval +1.13] [%cal Gd5d5,Ge4e4]A big centre, a free game, and his bishop wasted three moves.}  (5. a4 {Good, but the knight was still at home.}  d6 6. h3 Na6 7. Nf3 Nb4 {You got there anyway.})  (5. Qc2 {The queen is not the piece that needs a square.}  Na6 6. Bxa6 bxa6 7. Nf3 d6 {You helped him.})  (5. Nge2 {The knight is better on f3 in this structure.}  b5 6. Nxb5 Nxe4 7. Qc2 Nf6 {He got activity.}) 1-0

